WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.310
Roll call!

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.730
All right. You're all here!

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.570
Tonight, Yasuhiro is stuck
at work and won't be home!

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.150
I'm gonna die.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.080
And she...

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:18.610
Milady!

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.660
Milady!

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.290
...doesn't come on the weekends!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:23.820
That means...

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.290
I'm free!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.970
Yay!

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.520
Yay!

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:33.100
If only I didn't have that 
report to write for homework...

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.510
Milady!

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.760
Your bath is ready!

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:17.280
<b>Episode 4:  My Maid Reveres Young Girls</b>

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:13.770
Why are you here?

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.250
It's Saturday, right?!

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:20.190
Yes, your father has asked me to come 
over the weekend for the time being.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:22.030
You can't mean...

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:25.910
Yes. I'll be staying here overnight, as well.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:31.600
Don't worry. No matter what evil 
tries to attack you tonight,

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.430
I will protect you!

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.300
You're the most evil of them all!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.200
I'll have some cold dessert 
waiting for you after your bath.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.300
Listen to me!

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.020
I can't believe her...

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.590
Hey, don't just try to walk in here, too!

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:47.640
I'll wash your back.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.300
I can do that on my own!

00:02:58.640 --> 00:02:59.890
Um...

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:02.560
If I can't wash your back, 
how about your hair—

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:10.460
I'm sorry.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.630
I see.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.750
It doesn't matter how many 
of you come together...

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.730
You don't even register for me.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:39.880
I'll leave though, seeing 
how much you're trying.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.690
If I push too hard, she'll end up running.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:46.290
<i>You push when you need to push, 
and leave when the time's right.</i>

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.870
<i>If I do that...</i>

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.670
<i>She hasn't tried to take 
a bath with me lately...</i>

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:00.080
<i>Did she lose interest in me?</i>

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.210
Tsubame...

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:06.260
You know...

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:11.020
You can take a bath with me, if you want.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:13.640
Milady!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.280
Tsubame!

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.400
Just maybe!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.140
I know just how to make someone love me!

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.820
Go away already!

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.990
<i>I mean I know she gives 
me anything I need, but...</i>

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:33.870
<i>At the same time, I can't 
let my guard down at all.</i>

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.380
<i>I have homework to do, too.</i>

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.380
The theme for your report will be...

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.380
<b>Future Dreams</b>

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.960
Your dreams for the future.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.380
<i>And for any dreams...</i>

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:50.950
I want to stay at home, play 
games all day, and be lazy.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.820
I'm sure the teacher would get 
mad at me, if I wrote that.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:59.680
<i>Why do people have to work?</i>

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:04.180
<i>I could eat meagerly off the insurance 
money once Yasuhiro dies, I bet.</i>

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:13.910
I lost my father when I was about your age.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:17.000
And that's when I decided
I wanted to fly through the sky.

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:22.400
<i>I wonder why she joined the JSDF...</i>

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.740
You want to know why I joined the JSDF?

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:28.590
Yes.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.220
Milady...

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:31.720
...is interested...

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.350
...in me?

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:38.480
Once you sign and stamp these 
marriage papers, I'll file them!

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:39.810
What a pain!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.340
I'm not asking her!

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:46.590
I couldn't think of anything for my report...

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.280
I have until tomorrow night, anyway!

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.300
I'm going to eat that dessert and play games!

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:56.250
Thinking this way gets a lot of people in trouble.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:00.210
The young girl still was unaware of that fact.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.380
Milady.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.300
Hmm?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.540
I'm going to take a bath, too.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:09.690
Sure.

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:12.460
I'll leave the door open a little bit.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:13.720
I'm not going to look!

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.440
The water's nice.

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:22.860
Everything that Milady left 
behind is soaking into my pores.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:27.030
Water from a pure Russian little girl...

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.570
That could become the most 
famous hot spring in the world!

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.310
Menu

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.310
<b>Standby Mode
 Turn Off
 Restart</b>

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:34.580
<b>Preparing to shut off</b>

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.330
I should get to bed...

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:42.840
<i>I haven't seen her since...</i>

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:49.450
I've warmed your bed for you!

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:50.970
Stop doing weird stuff!

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:53.450
When did you get in here, anyway?

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:57.850
Well, you were paying so much 
attention to your game...

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.010
No, you die!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:07.220
Yeah!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.370
I'm good at being sneaky.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.370
Anyway, I'm going to turn off the lights.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.880
Get out!

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.000
I can sleep on the floor!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.730
Jeez...

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:30.270
I wanted to breathe the same 
breaths while you slept.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:31.130
Perv!

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.240
It's morning...

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:45.900
She's not here.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.110
<i>The weather's nice.</i>

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:54.370
<i>Time to play some games.</i>

00:07:54.840 --> 00:08:01.480
<b>Morning</b>

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.180
Milady, would you like to try this on?

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:01.000
No.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:05.910
<b>Afternoon</b>

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.100
Want to have a picnic?

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:04.800
No.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:09.620
<b>Night</b>

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:08.520
Milady!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:09.180
Shut up.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.730
I've gotten to the 11th chapter.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.260
I wonder if I'm almost to the end.

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:19.840
Anyway, I guess I'll get ready 
for tomorrow and go to sleep.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:28.940
I've got you evil!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.350
Where's the enemy?

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:33.120
Are they using optical camouflage?!

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:34.490
There's no one here!

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.530
Stop destroying the door!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.410
I'll fix it later!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:41.150
So what was that scream about?

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:43.710
It's nothing...

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.300
Hmm?

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.110
Here you are.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:49.080
I see.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.610
Your homework, huh?

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:53.870
And from that scream just now, you 
have to do it by tomorrow, I bet.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:57.220
Then let's hurry up and finish it.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.760
I would have finished it up, if I could have.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.410
Then let's do this.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.100
Hmm?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:06.810
I'll interview you, so answer my questions.

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:10.700
Then we just have to take those 
answers and turn them into a report.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:11.820
I see!

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:15.430
What dreams do you have for the future?

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:17.130
Hmm...

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.630
Keeping things the way they are?

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:21.020
So basically you want someone to support you,

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:24.480
have all your chores done, 
and play games everyday.

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:25.500
Yeah, that's right!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.810
Then why not marry someone 
with a lot of money?

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:31.140
So that's how I'd do that, I guess...

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:32.090
I see.

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:34.550
I have quite a bit of money.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:35.820
Huh?

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:37.680
Is Yasuhiro paying that much?

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:42.660
No, I'm getting paid a reasonable 
amount from your father.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.590
However, my side job is doing quite well.

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:45.680
Side job?

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:49.580
I hand make doll clothes as a hobby.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.360
They fetch pretty decent prices at auction.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.420
I see.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.310
About 500,000 yen a month.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:57.110
Wow!

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:59.100
Let's get married.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:09:59.870
Not happening.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.370
Huh?

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:04.610
You know, I want things 
like the way they are—

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:07.870
but peaceful, and without you around!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:11.130
Even though I do so much for 
you and have so much money?

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:14.210
That's still not enough to help your case.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.880
I understand.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.500
You understand?!

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:22.680
Some missions are worth accomplishing 
because of their sheer difficult.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.220
I'm going to get you to like me.

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.090
No matter what.

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:26.230
You don't get it!

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:30.150
Actually, if you're making 
that money, then why work here?

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.030
What are you saying?

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:38.400
What better work is there in this world 
than taking care of a cute Russian girl?

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:42.580
I'm doing my side job so I can 
keep doing my primary one.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:43.660
That being said...

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:45.830
I like clothing,

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.250
and I have customers that 
have a lot of money.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.610
Both of my jobs fulfill me in a way,

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:53.130
and I have a lot of fun doing them.

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:56.760
I see.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:00.510
I think I know how to write my paper now.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:02.960
You can leave now.

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:03.760
Huh?

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.890
<i>Have something worth doing that you like...</i>

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:11.770
<i>And money!</i>

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:19.850
My future dream is work with something 
to do with the animals that I love.

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:22.890
A vet, a caretaker, a groomer—

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.780
there are a lot of jobs out there.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:27.090
But I want to figure out 
what job is best for me.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:31.380
Also, I'll consider the various incomes, 
how much time each job requires,

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.970
and how fulfilling they will be.

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:34.170
Then I'll make my decision.

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:38.670
Also, I'd like to figure out 
other ways to increase my assets.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:43.680
I want to be independent as fast as possible,
 and live in an extremely secure house.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.970
A place where that woman can't get close.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:47.700
A house extremely well-guarded!

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:52.950
That's a rather realistic 
dream for a second grader.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:54.440
Everyone applaud.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.360
<i>If I become independent,</i>

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.600
<i>then that woman won't need to 
interfere with me any further.</i>

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.360
<i>I'll be able to protect my Mom's space, too.</i>

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.780
<i>I think I need to call 
Misha-chan's father after this.</i>

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.870
I knew it was here.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.860
<b>Future dreams</b>

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:16.860
"My future dreams."

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:18.340
"Kamoi Tsubame."

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:22.660
"My future dream is to become a pilot."

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:25.760
"The reason why I want to become a pilot is..."

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:40.900
<i>Do doll clothes really make that much money?</i>

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.750
<i>These are worth more than 30,000 yen.</i>

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.200
<i>Wow.</i>

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:58.920
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:03.970
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.090
So cute!

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:12.160
My apartment doesn't let me have 
any pets, so I'm really jealous.

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.100
Hey!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.100
Can I go over to your house and see?

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:16.910
Huh?!

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.600
<i>A classmate is going to come 
over to my house to play?</i>

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:24.480
<b>Event</b>

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.490
<i>That's like an event popular people have!</i>

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.700
<i>Event... Event...</i>

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.120
S-Sorry.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.840
Guess I shouldn't have invited 
myself over like that...

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:31.950
It's fine.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.460
You better come!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:36.070
O-Okay. Th-Thanks...

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.830
Anyway, I'm going to ask 
my mom at home if I can go.

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:42.840
Okay, see you later!

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:44.860
<i>"See you later..."</i>

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:48.340
<i>It's like what popular people would say!</i>

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:51.030
<i>I'll show her the hamsters and Kumagoro...</i>

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.600
<i>We'll eat snacks together.</i>

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.100
<i>Then we'll play a fighting game of some sort.</i>

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:58.600
<i>I've never played with a real 
person, except for Yasuhiro.</i>

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:00.730
I'm home!

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:04.150
Welcome back, Milady.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.750
<i>I forgot!</i>

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:11.370
<i>No, I made myself forget, so
I wouldn't feel bad all the time!</i>

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.260
<i>I completely forgot about her!</i>

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:16.250
<i>What should I do...</i>

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:16.250
<i>If Washizaki-san ends up meeting her...</i>

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.000
<b>Pattern A</b>

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.320
Hello.

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:25.510
Little girl...

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:27.750
<b>Pattern B</b>

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:30.100
Hello—

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:32.510
Huh?

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:36.560
You insolent fool, trying to get 
between Milady and me!

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.480
<i>Either one would be bad.</i>

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:42.930
Get out of here, or die!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.750
Somewhere your corpse 
won't get in the way!

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:46.110
<i>What's wrong all of a sudden?</i>

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.100
I haven't finished preparing dinner,

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:51.530
so I can't die...

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.370
I'm letting the Salisbury steak 
patties rest right now...

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.330
<i>Salisbury steak...</i>

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.830
In that case, don't set one 
foot outside the kitchen!

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:00.400
Why?

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:03.540
I won't listen to you, if you don't 
give me a reasonable explanation.

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:08.050
<i>I can't let her know about Washizaki-san...</i>

00:15:09.310 --> 00:15:10.300
That was fast!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.400
Coming!

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.980
Don't open it!

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:19.140
H-Hello.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.330
Welcome.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:27.170
You're Washizaki Mimika-sama,
a friend from Milady's school, yes?

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.450
I am the maid here, Kamoi Tsubame.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:32.110
Please come in.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:32.950
Huh?

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:37.870
<i>I guess she can act proper, if she wants.</i>

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:42.880
<i>But I haven't told her Washizaki-san's 
name, so why does she know?</i>

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:46.730
<i>Collecting data on the 
Milady is my hobby—</i>

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.630
<i>No, my job.</i>

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:49.700
<i>I've memorized my rivals—</i>

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:52.890
<i>I mean— the faces and names 
of your school friends.</i>

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.800
<i>May my feelings for you reach you!</i>

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:56.950
Come on!

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:57.560
Huh?

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.690
It's Kumagoro! How cute!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.600
Kumagoro, say hi!

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.310
He's smart!

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.610
This is the big one, the middle 
one, and the small one.

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:14.990
The hamsters, too?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.090
They really like you.

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.170
You think so?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:20.870
Yeah.

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.760
I always thought that hamsters 
were something you'd

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.370
find covered in dust and 
dead behind your dresser

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:29.130
when cleaning, if you let them 
run around on their own.

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:29.120
<b>Dead</b>

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.670
That wouldn't happen.

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.360
You guys will come if I call for you, right?

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:36.680
Takanashi-san, wait.
Can you talk to animals?

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:39.250
Huh? You can't?

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.640
You normally can't!

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.100
I-I see...

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:48.730
<i>Maybe it's because I've had so few friends 
that all I do is talk to animals.</i>

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:52.400
<i>So that means Washizaki-san 
must think I'm weird!</i>

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:53.590
Wow!

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:55.910
You could easily take care of animals!

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:00.140
<i>Sh-She gave me a compliment.</i>

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:05.110
I've brought you some tea and snacks.

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:06.450
That smells good.

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:08.380
They're freshly baked.

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:14.370
This is really good!

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.820
It's nice and flaky.

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:25.230
I brought some snacks, too.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.230
<b>Potato Chips
 Super Lightly Salted</b>

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:28.100
Sorry, they don't really work with this meal.

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:29.210
It's fine!

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:30.890
I like lightly salted stuff, too!

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:34.670
When you eat something sweet, 
you want to eat something salty.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:38.290
Not only did you make me realize
something that I had missed,

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:41.860
you also covered for me. 
I thank you, Washizaki-sama.

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.290
S-Sure...

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.540
<i>What's going on? She's acting perfectly.</i>

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.790
By the way, Washizaki-sama...

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:51.610
Could you try this on?

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:53.300
<i>I knew she wouldn't work out.</i>

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:54.790
You know—

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:56.570
Wow, that's pretty!

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.180
Huh?

00:17:57.560 --> 00:18:00.710
I have two little brothers, 
and they always get me dirty.

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:03.810
I can't wear pretty clothes like that.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.310
Will you wear them?!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.070
Why not try it on, Washizaki-san?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.940
Are you sure?

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.450
Here you are.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.590
I'll be looking over there.

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.540
I'll help you put it on.

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:23.240
You look over there, too!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:24.040
Huh?

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.710
Wh-What do you think?

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:33.670
<i>You're such a lolicon.</i>

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.130
It looks great on you!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.410
Yeah.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:39.770
But I wear glasses.

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:40.590
Huh?

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:45.530
My hair is thick and it goes all 
over the place, unless I braid it.

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:49.600
It would have worked better if I had nice 
flowing blonde hair like you, Takanashi-san.

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:54.360
I-I like black hair.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:58.250
Everyone looks at you 
if you have blonde hair.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:02.820
Sorry! I always look, too.

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:07.550
I mean your hair glows in the sun.

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:09.620
It's really pretty.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:15.380
You don't like your hair, Takanashi-san?

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:17.130
I do...

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:20.170
It's the same color as my mom's.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:25.950
But your hair has shine to it, 
and it's really pretty, too!

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:32.620
Two little girls are having 
fun talking to each other...

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:33.760
How precious...

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:34.500
How precious...

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:35.820
She's being taken away!

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:40.240
I almost went to Heaven just now.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.160
You should have.

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:44.310
Washizaki-sama.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:45.630
Y-Yes?

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.660
It seems that you're worried 
about your glasses, but...

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:50.250
Glasses are great!

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:53.160
She takes care of the animals in the class.
 She seems like a plain girl, but she has two little brothers,
 and is dependable.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:55.420
<b>Washizaki</b>

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.660
They can actually be a weapon!

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:53.210
Viva glasses girls!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.420
Hey, that's not right!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.800
If you're that worried,

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:02.500
then how about using decorative 
frames that match your clothing?

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:07.970
That's cute!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:08.870
Really?

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.940
Yeah, it's really cute with 
the temples as flowers.

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:16.010
You should try it on, too.

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:19.590
That's right, Milady! You put it on, too!

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:22.890
<b>Pressure</b>

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:21.910
Why won't you ever wear my clothes?!

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:22.910
<i>Pressure!</i>

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.360
I'm fine. It'd be hard to move in.

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:26.660
Makes it hard to laze about.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:30.910
But you wore stuff like that before 
you took time off of school, right?

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.940
Well, my mom liked stuff like that.

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:35.920
She'd do my hair, too.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.770
Right here! Me! Me! I'll do your hair!

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:41.810
I'd rather shave off all my 
hair than let you touch it!

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:42.860
No way!

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:45.550
<i>Huh? They don't get along?</i>

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.400
Thank you for today.

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.810
It was fun.

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:53.810
Me, too.

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:59.320
I always hated my hair and glasses.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:02.350
But today, I was able to 
like those parts of me.

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.950
It's all thanks to your 
maid, and you, Misha-chan.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.560
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:09.740
I guess I shouldn't have 
called you by your name.

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:11.870
N-No.

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:13.830
<i>She's calling me by my name!</i>

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.170
<i>It's like we're friends!</i>

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:18.250
I-I'll do the same, then...

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:21.380
Can I call you Washiwashi?!

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:23.510
W-Washiwashi?

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.300
Sure... No one else calls me that.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.020
<i>A special nickname!</i>

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:29.680
<i>It's like we're friends!</i>

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.300
See you tomorrow at school, Washiwashi!

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:36.190
Y-Yeah, see you later.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:37.640
Washiwashi!

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:39.240
Washiwashi!

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:41.820
Washiwashi, huh?

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:42.910
So precious...

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.650
So precious...

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:46.450
So precious...

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:48.110
So precious...

00:21:48.640 --> 00:21:49.310
So precious...

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.520
Hey!

00:21:58.930 --> 00:22:00.720
My hair...

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:04.800
Maybe I'll...

00:22:06.350 --> 00:22:08.360
Do it right for once...
